;;-*-Lisp-*-
(in-package goal)

;; name: texture-anim.gc
;; name in dgo: texture-anim
;; dgos: ENGINE, GAME

;; og:preserve-this landing notes: the anim machinery (init-textures! symbol
;; resolution, the init funcs that build the tex/clut records, the clut
;; generators) lands live; every GS draw/upload path (draw-mips, the layer
;; funcs, the clut uploads' DMA halves) stays commented - on PC those must
;; never run (jak3 parity: its versions are break! stubs). update-texture-anim
;; is a minimal PC port, see its docstring.

